    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375220/extras/9df497cd6a708fa8763380b42e965d77.webp?t=1741179459\" width=616 height=60 /></span>Get ready for an exciting adventure where you will have to find 10 differences between two similar images with cute dogs. This is not only fun, but also a great training for your attention and observation. Enjoy the colorful pictures and interesting details!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;In the whole history of the world there is but one thing that money can not buy... to wit - the wag of a dog's tail.&quot;</i>\u00a0\u2013 Josh Billings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 unique levels with cute dogs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cartoon style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable for all ages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual gameplay</p></li></ul>",
